Well, if you think he was drunk and he really was drunk, that means you
are right (about him being drunk)
The real question would be, if he was right (about your AC increasing
randomly). And the answer to that would be:
Your AC depends on three things: Your natural AC (which is 10 by
default, can be decreased by your god and set back to ten again by you,
if you act stupidly), your armor-AC (which does not change, except if
you (dis)enchant the armor) and the AC-bonus you get by the
protection-spell, which indeed wears off by time.

